      "message": "feat(ui): viewport origin gizmos wear their names (#641)\n\nEach work-offset triad labels its origin with the entity name the\nSetup pane shows (G54, Setup2/WCS) in bright triad blue; the dimmed\nworld axes label theirs World in neutral gray dimmed like the lines\nunder them. Labels ride gizmos(), so the pane's eye and show-world-\naxes gate drop a name with its lines; only X/Y/Z keep the big letter\nfont. setup_chip_tests' no-G54 clause narrows to plane chips - the\norigin name is Setup1's own, legitimately.",
